(6223121, 919662, 122131, '<td valign="top">Really amazing and inspiring work.<br/>Very detailed, sharp, eye-catching (pun?).. Focus is perfect, dof is perfect.<br/>Only annoyance would be the black triangle on the bottom-right, but understand that with these shots you can''t really plan ahead. As such, I won''t let it influence my score.<br/>Can''t praise it enough. I hope to see it in the front page.<br/>10.</td>', 'Really amazing and inspiring work.Very detailed, sharp, eye-catching (pun?).. Focus is perfect, dof is perfect.Only annoyance would be the black triangle on the bottom-right, but understand that with these shots you can''t really plan ahead. As such, I won''t let it influence my score.Can''t praise it enough. I hope to see it in the front page.10.', '2010-11-15 06:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6223126, 919839, 122131, '<td valign="top">One of the best so far! <br/>I think it''s the band-aids in the righ hand that completes it for me!<br/>10, and I''d imagine I will be seeing it in the top-three.</td>', 'One of the best so far! I think it''s the band-aids in the righ hand that completes it for me!10, and I''d imagine I will be seeing it in the top-three.', '2010-11-15 06:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
