(6223232, 919862, 15711, '<td valign="top">Worthy of a laundry detergent or fabric softener ad.  I like the crisp focus.  Well done.</td>', 'Worthy of a laundry detergent or fabric softener ad.  I like the crisp focus.  Well done.', '2010-11-15 09:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
