(6223339, 920010, 99263, '<td valign="top">Absolutely super....stunning in fact. This grabbed me immediately and for a reason too as it reminds me very much of an image drawn by the famous Dutch artist Anton Pieck and used as illustration in the Dutch translation of the book "The incredible journey of Nils Holgersson" by Swedish author Selma Lagerlöf. Here is the picture I am talking about. I''m sure you can see the connection.<br/><a href="//vykort.gotdns.org/img/4283.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//vykort.gotdns.org/img/4283.jpg</a></td>', 'Absolutely super....stunning in fact. This grabbed me immediately and for a reason too as it reminds me very much of an image drawn by the famous Dutch artist Anton Pieck and used as illustration in the Dutch translation of the book "The incredible journey of Nils Holgersson" by Swedish author Selma Lagerlöf. Here is the picture I am talking about. I''m sure you can see the connection.//vykort.gotdns.org/img/4283.jpg', '2010-11-15 10:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
