(6223405, 919918, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent image but I fail to see a true subject that''s off center, and the title points me to fog, which is everywhere. I''m not voting, just making observations. As a photo I give it a 9 for the tones and the mood and the clarity of what needs to be clear vs. the mystery of what''s not; but I don''t know how voters will place it in this challenge. This type of photo to me is more about what you barely see than the tree that''s front and center. i hope that makes sense and isn''t too critical. Again, not voting.</td>', 'Excellent image but I fail to see a true subject that''s off center, and the title points me to fog, which is everywhere. I''m not voting, just making observations. As a photo I give it a 9 for the tones and the mood and the clarity of what needs to be clear vs. the mystery of what''s not; but I don''t know how voters will place it in this challenge. This type of photo to me is more about what you barely see than the tree that''s front and center. i hope that makes sense and isn''t too critical. Again, not voting.', '2010-11-15 11:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
