(6223423, 919301, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but it''s lacking clarity and the colors seem a bit too compressed or something. I''m not voting, just making comments, so please don''t take it the wrong way. The blue sky seems a little too cyan-colored and there''s a feeling that it''s not natural. I think a slight recomposition to include more of the foreground field and even a perspective closer to the ground would have helped this (unless you were shooting over a fence; nothing you can do about that).<br/> <br/>I would have gone with your composition had the clouds been dramatic, but as it is the blue sky isn''t adding to the scene, whereas some of the details in the foreground may have. Without going on this has a ton of potential and it''s well spotted, but I''m afraid the voters might ding it up a bit for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice scene, but it''s lacking clarity and the colors seem a bit too compressed or something. I''m not voting, just making comments, so please don''t take it the wrong way. The blue sky seems a little too cyan-colored and there''s a feeling that it''s not natural. I think a slight recomposition to include more of the foreground field and even a perspective closer to the ground would have helped this (unless you were shooting over a fence; nothing you can do about that). I would have gone with your composition had the clouds been dramatic, but as it is the blue sky isn''t adding to the scene, whereas some of the details in the foreground may have. Without going on this has a ton of potential and it''s well spotted, but I''m afraid the voters might ding it up a bit for this challenge.', '2010-11-15 11:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
