(6224941, 919971, 122131, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured -- I particularly like the reflections in the bird''s eyes..<br/>The dof is spot on. The bird is perfectly sharp, and the raindrops give it a very nice  touch.<br/>8.</td>', 'Very nicely captured -- I particularly like the reflections in the bird''s eyes..The dof is spot on. The bird is perfectly sharp, and the raindrops give it a very nice  touch.8.', '2010-11-16 21:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224945, 920044, 122131, '<td valign="top">I found this photo really appealing.<br/>The earthy colours, the crispy dried up leaves, all works together.<br/>The angle of the mushroom works great, and you captured great detail there.<br/>The vignette works well, but I unfortunately find it a bit too dark toward the left, to the point where  the colours begin to lose vibrance., and start becoming dull and shapeless.<br/>I''d love to see the image without it.<br/>7 from me.</td>', 'I found this photo really appealing.The earthy colours, the crispy dried up leaves, all works together.The angle of the mushroom works great, and you captured great detail there.The vignette works well, but I unfortunately find it a bit too dark toward the left, to the point where  the colours begin to lose vibrance., and start becoming dull and shapeless.I''d love to see the image without it.7 from me.', '2010-11-16 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
