(6224967, 920017, 93565, '<td valign="top">Things feel a little soft, but what''s hindering things more for me is the red light from the umbrella. Just makes me feel like I''m in a dance club or something. (not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'Things feel a little soft, but what''s hindering things more for me is the red light from the umbrella. Just makes me feel like I''m in a dance club or something. (not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 21:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
