(6224987, 919866, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like how spooky feeling this is. The squiggle in the reflections really add to that end. I might''ve liked to see the stranger a bit more right of center with more of the walkway to the left, so further pull us into the scene, but very good as is.<br/>(not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'I really like how spooky feeling this is. The squiggle in the reflections really add to that end. I might''ve liked to see the stranger a bit more right of center with more of the walkway to the left, so further pull us into the scene, but very good as is.(not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224988, 919301, 88235, '<td valign="top">seems out of focust...</td>', 'seems out of focust...', '2010-11-16 22:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224992, 919974, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s curious how the lines of your photo lead us away from the subject matter. While in many cases, I would say this is odd or perhaps contrary to the effect, it works splendidly here- asking us to ignore the supervision we live in, making it secondary and accepted. Nice photo. (not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'It''s curious how the lines of your photo lead us away from the subject matter. While in many cases, I would say this is odd or perhaps contrary to the effect, it works splendidly here- asking us to ignore the supervision we live in, making it secondary and accepted. Nice photo. (not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 22:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6224999, 919944, 93565, '<td valign="top">This photo just really makes me want to know the backstory of things. But, at the same time, I''m almost hesitant to find out, preferring perhaps instead what I''ve constructed from my own experience.<br/>Great shot.<br/>(not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'This photo just really makes me want to know the backstory of things. But, at the same time, I''m almost hesitant to find out, preferring perhaps instead what I''ve constructed from my own experience.Great shot.(not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225001, 919839, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a very well done staged shot. Nice lighting, posing, effect, attention to details (the bandaids are an excellent addition).<br/>(not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'This is a very well done staged shot. Nice lighting, posing, effect, attention to details (the bandaids are an excellent addition).(not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 22:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225002, 920021, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really love the warm tones of this, and the sparseness of the subject matter. Very cool. (not voting, fellow entrant)</td>', 'I really love the warm tones of this, and the sparseness of the subject matter. Very cool. (not voting, fellow entrant)', '2010-11-16 22:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
