(6225055, 919701, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. I like the processing on this one. It takes an ordinary setting and turns it into a more interesting setting.</td>', 'Cute photo. I like the processing on this one. It takes an ordinary setting and turns it into a more interesting setting.', '2010-11-16 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225056, 920017, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and idea to this one. However, the lack of sharpness in the model, the high noise, and especially the very over-saturated umbrella make this a sub par photo. You are on the right track though!</td>', 'Nice composition and idea to this one. However, the lack of sharpness in the model, the high noise, and especially the very over-saturated umbrella make this a sub par photo. You are on the right track though!', '2010-11-16 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225057, 920068, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of an everyday sight. The leading lines are what really make this, and unfortunately, also hurt it, in my opinion. That power line going horizontal through the photo really messes with the leading lines, and takes the eyes off the main subject.</td>', 'Nice use of an everyday sight. The leading lines are what really make this, and unfortunately, also hurt it, in my opinion. That power line going horizontal through the photo really messes with the leading lines, and takes the eyes off the main subject.', '2010-11-16 22:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225062, 919827, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think I get what you were going for here, but I feel the photo misses the mark. It''s a bit to cluttered to really say "silence". Maybe instead if only one to three windmills were in the shot, that would have helped.</td>', 'I think I get what you were going for here, but I feel the photo misses the mark. It''s a bit to cluttered to really say "silence". Maybe instead if only one to three windmills were in the shot, that would have helped.', '2010-11-16 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225064, 919574, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. A telling story, with nice editing to make it even more interesting.</td>', 'I like this. A telling story, with nice editing to make it even more interesting.', '2010-11-16 23:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225068, 920037, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do like the thought behind this, but the green background is causing a wild color cast on the pot, and making it look not nearly as nice. Being advanced editing, I think you could have gotten a better shot with a white background that you later colored green.</td>', 'I do like the thought behind this, but the green background is causing a wild color cast on the pot, and making it look not nearly as nice. Being advanced editing, I think you could have gotten a better shot with a white background that you later colored green.', '2010-11-16 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225069, 919435, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space and minimal colors.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space and minimal colors.', '2010-11-16 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225072, 919962, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a great title for this photo. The image itself is sub par in my opinion. Just not sharp enough and a bit too much noise for my taste.</td>', 'What a great title for this photo. The image itself is sub par in my opinion. Just not sharp enough and a bit too much noise for my taste.', '2010-11-16 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225074, 919811, 114225, '<td valign="top">Huh, so the subject is the house? That really isn''t what caught my eye as the subject. To me, the entire rainy day scene, looking more specifically at the trees surrounding the edges is the subject.</td>', 'Huh, so the subject is the house? That really isn''t what caught my eye as the subject. To me, the entire rainy day scene, looking more specifically at the trees surrounding the edges is the subject.', '2010-11-16 23:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225084, 920095, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot that I really enjoy. This is either the hardest puzzle in the work, or the backs of the pieces.</td>', 'Very creative shot that I really enjoy. This is either the hardest puzzle in the work, or the backs of the pieces.', '2010-11-16 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225091, 919497, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice overall composition. I really like the amount of color here. One thing that I noticed pretty quickly (and I don''t notice this easily often) is the high amount of chromatic aberration, especially along the right edge of the tree. I''m betting this is hurting your score a bit.</td>', 'Nice overall composition. I really like the amount of color here. One thing that I noticed pretty quickly (and I don''t notice this easily often) is the high amount of chromatic aberration, especially along the right edge of the tree. I''m betting this is hurting your score a bit.', '2010-11-16 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225093, 919541, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! The sharpness and depth of field combine to make this simply stunning.</td>', 'Excellent capture! The sharpness and depth of field combine to make this simply stunning.', '2010-11-16 23:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
