(6225515, 919985, 30364, '<td valign="top">Elegantly executed with uncommon restraint.  It''s a lovely photograph and it''s my second-top pick in this otherwise largely lifeless and imaginatively leaden challenge.  9.  Thank you.</td>', 'Elegantly executed with uncommon restraint.  It''s a lovely photograph and it''s my second-top pick in this otherwise largely lifeless and imaginatively leaden challenge.  9.  Thank you.', '2010-11-17 06:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
