(6225754, 919732, 107516, '<td valign="top">Nice one. I vote for this one cause i am expecting the subject to be seen as a whole subject, not just the shoes but the child itself. It literally feels off-centered.</td>', 'Nice one. I vote for this one cause i am expecting the subject to be seen as a whole subject, not just the shoes but the child itself. It literally feels off-centered.', '2010-11-17 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225806, 919918, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo, with the slight green cast and composition. I''m not seeing how it really fits into the theme (seems like the entire scene is the subject, which is inherently centered).</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo, with the slight green cast and composition. I''m not seeing how it really fits into the theme (seems like the entire scene is the subject, which is inherently centered).', '2010-11-17 11:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225808, 919824, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great smile on that dog! Perfect pose, and good use of negative space. My main criticism is the black object in the left side. That''s really distracting, and it seems like it could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Great smile on that dog! Perfect pose, and good use of negative space. My main criticism is the black object in the left side. That''s really distracting, and it seems like it could have been cropped out.', '2010-11-17 11:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225810, 920036, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photo. I really like the composition, and sharpness. I''m not too keen on the black and white conversion for this shot. To me, it seems like it would have been more powerful as color.</td>', 'What a wonderful photo. I really like the composition, and sharpness. I''m not too keen on the black and white conversion for this shot. To me, it seems like it would have been more powerful as color.', '2010-11-17 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6225811, 919357, 30861, '<td valign="top">That should be "systemic risk" surely? Or am I missing something obvious? No matter...</td>', 'That should be "systemic risk" surely? Or am I missing something obvious? No matter...', '2010-11-17 11:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
