(6226806, 919839, 108580, '<td valign="top">Always creative and superb execution, if you will pardon the pun.<br/>Only flaw, the tomatoe (you say tomato) should only have one slice through it :) The plastered fingers show 3 misses :) It would be difficult to throw it up in three pieces and keep them together as photographed. <br/>But what do I know, I''m not Gordon Ramsay :)</td>', 'Always creative and superb execution, if you will pardon the pun.Only flaw, the tomatoe (you say tomato) should only have one slice through it :) The plastered fingers show 3 misses :) It would be difficult to throw it up in three pieces and keep them together as photographed. But what do I know, I''m not Gordon Ramsay :)', '2010-11-18 09:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
