(6229669, 919952, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hope05cful:</b></div><hr/><i> THIS IS MORE EVEN THEN OFF-CENTERED A SUBJECT ON ONE SIDE AND OBJECT ON THE OTHER </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The challenge was off-centered SUBJECT... so I guess I got it right. Thanks</td>', 'Originally posted by hope05cful: THIS IS MORE EVEN THEN OFF-CENTERED A SUBJECT ON ONE SIDE AND OBJECT ON THE OTHER   The challenge was off-centered SUBJECT... so I guess I got it right. Thanks', '2010-11-22 04:57:56.000000', NULL, 0),
