(6229886, 919839, 58785, '<td valign="top">What a bunch of loosers.. 1s and a 2.... even 3s. Bull crappers. I am open to any fight (discussion) with those clowns.<br/> <br/>Anywho, that rant out of the way, I think a blue next time is in correct order looking at this lineup :)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.leokoach.com/download/gyaban.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.leokoach.com/download/gyaban.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.leokoach.com/download/gyaban.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-22 11:02:50.</i></td>', 'What a bunch of loosers.. 1s and a 2.... even 3s. Bull crappers. I am open to any fight (discussion) with those clowns. Anywho, that rant out of the way, I think a blue next time is in correct order looking at this lineup :) ', '2010-11-22 11:02:24.000000', '2010-11-22 11:02:50.000000', 0),
(6229887, 919839, 96751, '<td valign="top">So basically, you don''t go to the gym.  You just do 500 Tomato Slice Lunges.  You, Sir, are a fixture on the front page, and for very good reason.  Congrats on the <strike>tomato</strike> red.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-22 11:03:54.</i></td>', 'So basically, you don''t go to the gym.  You just do 500 Tomato Slice Lunges.  You, Sir, are a fixture on the front page, and for very good reason.  Congrats on the tomato red.', '2010-11-22 11:03:22.000000', '2010-11-22 11:03:54.000000', 0),
(6229888, 919971, 61315, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely detailed image of the Anna''s Hummingbird - much better than anything I''ve been able to come up with. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'This is such a lovely detailed image of the Anna''s Hummingbird - much better than anything I''ve been able to come up with. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2010-11-22 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
