(6229900, 919889, 83313, '<td valign="top">Got an 8 from me, as well. Wonderful detail and tones to this. We have a similar problem with the security patrols in Ft. Worth''s Sundance Square. One has to be extra careful to stay on public property or you WILL be chased off for taking photos. As long as I stay on the street or sidewalk, I haven''t been harassed, but the moment I step into any area like a patio outside a restaurant, bike cops show up to chase me off.</td>', 'Got an 8 from me, as well. Wonderful detail and tones to this. We have a similar problem with the security patrols in Ft. Worth''s Sundance Square. One has to be extra careful to stay on public property or you WILL be chased off for taking photos. As long as I stay on the street or sidewalk, I haven''t been harassed, but the moment I step into any area like a patio outside a restaurant, bike cops show up to chase me off.', '2010-11-22 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
