(6230125, 920067, 96751, '<td valign="top">All three are quirky and wonderful, if not particularly DPC "fodder".  This one is the best of the three for me - it is unusual and dynamic and so much fun.  The crop is brilliant and makes  me feel like we caught a private moment in a dog''s life.  Whether the others would have done better is impossible to say, and pointless to worry about :-)</td>', 'All three are quirky and wonderful, if not particularly DPC "fodder".  This one is the best of the three for me - it is unusual and dynamic and so much fun.  The crop is brilliant and makes  me feel like we caught a private moment in a dog''s life.  Whether the others would have done better is impossible to say, and pointless to worry about :-)', '2010-11-22 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6230129, 919839, 117474, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent shot, and well deserved 7.x! I''m surprised you got so many below-5''s to be honest. It was a great idea, well executed, and in terms of the challenge... only the rolled up sleeve on your left arm is central. It''s about as far from dnmc as my left hand! <br/>I loved the bandages on your right hand. Very nice touch. <br/> <br/>The only slight criticism I''d have with it was that when I looked at it your marriage ring was a little prominent. Ninjas woudln''t be married I''d''ve thought :)</td>', 'Wow. Excellent shot, and well deserved 7.x! I''m surprised you got so many below-5''s to be honest. It was a great idea, well executed, and in terms of the challenge... only the rolled up sleeve on your left arm is central. It''s about as far from dnmc as my left hand! I loved the bandages on your right hand. Very nice touch.  The only slight criticism I''d have with it was that when I looked at it your marriage ring was a little prominent. Ninjas woudln''t be married I''d''ve thought :)', '2010-11-22 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
