(6230465, 919944, 93565, '<td valign="top">I wanted to come back and look at this to see the details (my curiosity got the best of me). For me, the fact that it''s another artist''s piece detracts slightly, but not for the most part. To me, I think you have created your own depiction, your own interpretation. I think I like the bw more than color, as well. The red would strike me as too vibrant, lively, for the message. The weight would be lessened in my eye. Good job, and bummer it didn''t score higher.</td>', 'I wanted to come back and look at this to see the details (my curiosity got the best of me). For me, the fact that it''s another artist''s piece detracts slightly, but not for the most part. To me, I think you have created your own depiction, your own interpretation. I think I like the bw more than color, as well. The red would strike me as too vibrant, lively, for the message. The weight would be lessened in my eye. Good job, and bummer it didn''t score higher.', '2010-11-22 23:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6230470, 919942, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think I like your entry more than the other version. It''s got more punch in the memorial itself, and I like the reflection on the water. The composition also focuses more on the memorial itself, whereas in the alternate, it''s secondary to the landscape.</td>', 'I think I like your entry more than the other version. It''s got more punch in the memorial itself, and I like the reflection on the water. The composition also focuses more on the memorial itself, whereas in the alternate, it''s secondary to the landscape.', '2010-11-22 23:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
