(6230666, 920072, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to if you were aware of this image before shooting <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=712762" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/910/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_712762.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/910/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_712762.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/910/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_712762.jpg"/></a> <br/>It''s always interesting to me to see how we, as photographers, solve problems in the same fashion and inadvertently replicate each other, and how we each do things differently. I didn''t vote (since I entered), but immediately thought of that photo.<br/>What is it that didn''t turn out to your expectations about the shot?</td>', 'I''m curious as to if you were aware of this image before shooting  It''s always interesting to me to see how we, as photographers, solve problems in the same fashion and inadvertently replicate each other, and how we each do things differently. I didn''t vote (since I entered), but immediately thought of that photo.What is it that didn''t turn out to your expectations about the shot?', '2010-11-23 02:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
